      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berrien_Township%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The township occupies the southeast portion of Berrien County, bordering Oronoko Charter Township to the west.",
